# Job-server runtime state (see June-2026/server/)
# The job database and per-job output trees are generated at run time and can
# reach hundreds of MB per job; results worth keeping are promoted into
# results/ deliberately, not committed wholesale from the working tree.
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
June-2026/project_src_package_2025/data_output/jobs/
June-2026/server/__pycache__/

# NOTE: compiled .pyc files are already tracked under the older snapshot
# directories (51 of them). They are deliberately not ignored here: a blanket
# __pycache__ rule would claim to exclude files git still tracks, which is
# more confusing than the status quo. Untracking them belongs with the
# snapshot-consolidation work, not here.
